[code-00001] helpful=0 harmful=0 :: When generating Excel files via Python, use `xlsxwriter` or `openpyxl` to explicitly define all tabs, headers, and formulas (e.g., `worksheet.write_formula`). Ensure the script populates every required column and row as specified in the source data and concludes with the file save command.
