[prin-00002] helpful=0 harmful=0 :: For document-generation tasks, prioritize structural requirements (file format, tab names, column headers) as the primary framework. Treat data processing logic as a secondary step encapsulated within the generation code to ensure the final artifact is ready for immediate use.
